= Spells =
*[[Shaman_Spells|Shaman Spell Table]]
Shamans are masters of natural magic that inflicts poison, disease, cold and magic damage upon their enemies. They also have the ability to vastly empower their allies with Haste or destructively weaken their foes with Slow and Malo.

